																																		<p class="text-14 md:text-18 text-white font-semibold">Membership</p>

													<h1 class="mb-4 leading-none text-40 lg:text-60">Membership <strong>Benefits</strong></h1>

														<div class="max-w-4xl leading-tight text-24 md:text-28">
		<p>Joining the world’s only independent authority for precious metals ensures your organisation gets a seat at the table of an internationally respected body and offers wide-ranging benefits.</p>
