																																																<h3 class="mb-6 font-medium leading-tight text-34">Gain Market Insight and Help Shape Future Direction</h3>
							
							<div class="mb-4 text-19 wysiwyg wysiwyg-panel"><div><strong>Have a seat at the table </strong>to steer the future development of the global industry by informing work with regulators and governments.<br /><br /><strong>Join working groups and market committees </strong>which advance global standards and develop market solutions.</div>



<p><strong><br />Have your views </strong>represented on key legislation and regulatory issues, and gain access to weekly briefings, the <em>Alchemist</em> and topical webinars.</p></div>						</div>

																							</div>
									</div>
																			

				
																
				<div class="mb-8 md:w-1/2 md:px-4 flex">
											<div class="flex flex-col relative items-start group bg-center bg-cover shadow-lg p-6 w-full">
											<div class="flex-auto w-full">
															<div class="mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100" height="65" viewBox="0 0 100 65" fill="none">
  <path d="M0 0H100V64.4068H0V0Z" fill="white"></path>
  <path d="M42.3729 8.47461H74.5763V49.1526H42.3729V8.47461Z" fill="#D1F0F1"></path>
