</svg>
</div>
							
																																																<h3 class="mb-6 font-medium leading-tight text-34">Access to Specialist Knowledge, Resources and Advice</h3>
							
							<div class="mb-4 text-19 wysiwyg wysiwyg-panel"><p><strong>Expert guidan</strong><strong>ce and technical expertise</strong> on physical, compliance and regulatory issues from the LBMA team and other senior industry members.<br /><br /><strong>Express your concerns</strong> to the regulator from an impartial perspective.<br /><br /><strong>Earn CPD points</strong> when attending LBMA webinars and selected events. Plus, Terminal Markets Order (TMO) VAT conditions are applicable to LBMA Full Members.</p></div>						</div>

																							</div>
									</div>
																			

				
																
				<div class="mb-8 md:w-1/2 md:px-4 flex">
											<div class="flex flex-col relative items-start group bg-center bg-cover shadow-lg p-6 w-full">
											<div class="flex-auto w-full">
