																																																<h3 class="mb-6 font-medium leading-tight text-34">Help Raise Standards and Develop the Market</h3>
							
							<div class="mb-4 text-19 wysiwyg wysiwyg-panel"><p><strong>Be part of market</strong> transparency initiatives such as LBMA Trade Data.<br /><br /><strong>Promote market confidence</strong> through attestation to the Global Precious Metals Code.<br /><br /><strong>Demonstrate best practice</strong> through engaging with our Responsible Sourcing Programme.</p></div>						</div>

