																																																<h3 class="mb-6 font-medium leading-tight text-34">Grow Your Network with Knowledge, Contacts and Expertise</h3>
							
							<div class="mb-4 text-19 wysiwyg wysiwyg-panel"><p><strong>Grow your business </strong>using the LBMA Members logos, plus the link to your organisation will be displayed on the LBMA website.<br /><br /><strong>Preferential rates </strong>for our events and training opportunities.<br /><br /><strong>Connect with other </strong><strong>industry leading members </strong>at complimentary networking events, workshops and general meetings.</p></div>						</div>

